content:
The sequence analysis strongly identifies a MurE-family peptidoglycan ligase: three high-confidence Swiss-Prot homologs share 46–50% identity over most of the sequence, and Pfam detects the characteristic Mur_ligase_M and Mur_ligase_C domains. I will now record these findings with provenance before verification.

